[Tips.RadRotDirBlur_S]
effect.name=Blur effect combining radial, rotational, and directional blur.
移動X=Direction of directional blur
移動Y=Direction of directional blur
拡大率=Zoom rate of radial blur
回転角=Angle of rotational blur
中心X=Center of radial and rotational blur
中心Y=Center of radial and rotational blur
色収差=The correct order in the real world is "Red-Blue". "A" makes transparent pixels darker than "B".
精度=Number of samples for blur calculations
